### Quick API Test - MyCrypto FastAPI v2.0
### Run these tests in sequence to verify basic functionality

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health

### 2. Create Test User
POST http://localhost:8000/users/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "quicktest@example.com",
  "name": "Quick Test User",
  "password": "test123"
}

### 3. Create BTC Asset
POST http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "BTC",
  "name": "Bitcoin",
  "current_price": 45000.00
}

### 4. Get All Users (should show our test user)
GET http://localhost:8000/users/

### 5. Get All Assets (should show BTC)
GET http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/

### 6. Create Portfolio Entry (replace IDs with actual values from steps 2 & 3)
POST http://localhost:8000/portfolio/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID",
  "asset_id": "REPLACE_WITH_BTC_ID", 
  "quantity": 0.1,
  "purchase_price": 44000.00
}

### 7. Get User Portfolio (replace with actual user ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/portfolio/user/REPLACE_WITH_USER_ID

### 8. API Documentation
GET http://localhost:8000/docs
